OL,3,GNEWSANumber plate camera plan to tackle
OL,4,ANinewells Hospital parking problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FNumber plate cameras could be used to
OL,7,Ftackle parking problems at Ninewells
OL,8,FHospital in Dundee, according to an NHS
OL,9,FTayside report.
OL,11,FThe health board launched a review
OL,12,Ffollowing complaints that patients,
OL,13,Fstaff and visitors regularly faced long
OL,14,Fqueues to get a parking space.
OL,16,FA traffic survey showed about 7,000
OL,17,Fvehicles normally enter the site
OL,18,Fbetween 07:00 and 15:00 on weekdays,
OL,19,Fdespite there only being 2,500
OL,20,Favailable spaces.
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
