OL,3,GNEWSANumber plate camera plan to tackle
OL,4,ANinewells Hospital parking problems
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking fees at the hospital were
OL,7,Fscrapped by the Scottish government in
OL,8,F2021, but there are claims that some
OL,9,Fdrivers use it as a park-and-ride to
OL,10,Ftravel into the city centre.
